cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "sret-rag: Self-Hosted RAG on a 4-PC LAN Cluster"
abstract: "Built for offline AI access at college with zero cloud dependency. Fully offline, self-hosted Retrieval-Augmented Generation system distributed across 4 budget PCs on a LAN: a FastAPI gateway, dedicated embedder, FAISS vector index, and a llama.cpp/Qwen2.5 LLM node. ChatGPT-style UI, cited answers, embed caching, doc dedup, and session-based auth."
